# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This portfolio is a fully static site: no environment variables are required
# to build or deploy it. Every value lives in `src/data/site.ts` and
# `site.config.ts` because they are public by definition (name, links, copy).
#
# If you later add a contact-form service (Formspree, Resend, a serverless
# function, …) or analytics, add the variable names here and set the values in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables. Never commit real values.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Example only — nothing below is currently used.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=
